Anker today announced the launch of Anker MindBase, an AI home hub meant to work with almost 100 Anker devices and Matter-enabled smart home devices from other companies. It works alongside <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/homekit/">HomeKit</a>, and is equipped with an AI Core compute card and the on-device Anker TrueSmart AI Agent.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/09/anker-mindbase.jpg" alt="" width="1319" height="742" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1062176" /><br/>
In addition to working as a smart home hub, the MindBase supports up to 48TB of local storage, and it functions as a NAS. It can be used for storing files, photos, and videos locally. MindBase integrates with Anker security cameras, and Anker plans to sell a MindBase Security Kit that includes a new TrackLight Cam S1, S4 Video Doorbell, and Smart Security Shield sensor.<br/>
<br/>
Anker says on-device AI evaluates events in real time to assess risk and respond through observation, lighting, verbal warnings, or active deterrence. The sensor can be placed at the edge of a property, using radar to detect strangers from up to 15 meters away.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/09/anker-doorbell.jpg" alt="" width="2517" height="1416" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1062177" /><br/>
Anker is also debuting several new home security products.<br/>
<ul><br/>
 	<li><strong>Eufy Video Doorbell S4</strong> - The Video Doorbell S4 is a wired doorbell and security camera combo. It has a 9-megapixel lens with 3K resolution and a 180-degree field of view.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Eufy Window Camera E10</strong> - The E10 is a camera that mounts on the inside of a window for use in rentals. It has a 25-degree adjustable tilt with anti-glare optics, and it records in 2.5K resolution.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Eufy Fall Detection Sensor</strong> - The Fall Detection Sensor is a non-wearable sensor that uses mmWave radar sensing to detect falls without using a camera. It can be mounted on the wall and supports two-way communication.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong>Eufy NVR Security System E50</strong> - The E50 pairs an 8-channel network video recorder with four hybrid bullet pan-tilt-zoom dual-lens camera. There's a 2K resolution wide-angle bullet lens and a motorized 4K resolution PTZ lens.</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
